{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:18 2026-11-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:18 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:18 2026-11-11 HKT</p><img alt=\"美國前總統拜登到愛爾蘭，出席兒子頒獎禮時遇襲。美聯社資料圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0025bd64ba3896ac096062eff3ad6aac/2026-11/544_-_2026-11-11T131625_225.jpg\"/><p>愛爾蘭媒體報道，美國前總統拜登（Joe Biden）當地時間周二（10日）在都柏林參加其子亨特（Hunter Biden）的頒獎典禮時，遭支持巴勒斯坦的抗議者襲擊。當拜登離開時，抗議者向其投擲牛奶盒等物品，被安保人員的雨傘擋下，警方隨後介入，至少兩人被捕。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:33:16.079911+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:18:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T05:26:30.210638+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T05:26:30.210638+00:00","content_hash":"bbab1889313299737a17405d09b1732432978766bd6d7ad67d0ab83ec4d7e9bc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}